  "comments": "Coin belonging to the Series dedicated to the death of John Paul II from the year 2005, commemorating his periods according to the following list:<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Priest</span> (1946-1958) 1 Cèntim &amp; 2 Cèntims / <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Bishop</span> (1958-1964) 5 Cèntims / <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Archbishop</span> (1964-1967) 10 Cèntims /<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Cardinal</span> (1967-1978) 25 Cèntims &amp; 50 Cèntims / <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Pope</span> (1978-2005) 1 Diner &amp; 2 Diners<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2005 BU Set</span><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6502d405286f0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6502d405286f0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"142\" /></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6502d41035d34.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6502d41035d34.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"142\" /></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6502d41e6a271.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6502d41e6a271.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"141\" /></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6502d42fdf0c0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6502d42fdf0c0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"141\" /></a>",
